# LAB 10: Implement Data Protection

## Lab introduction  
In this lab, you learn about backing up and recovering Azure VMs. You will:  
- Create a Recovery Services vault and backup policy  
- Configure VM-level backup  
- Monitor Azure Backup  
- Enable VM replication (disaster recovery with Azure Site Recovery)  
