## Task 1: Use a template to provision infrastructure  

1. Download the lab files (template + parameters).  
2. Sign in to the Azure portal.  
3. Search “Deploy a custom template” → select “Build your own template in the editor.”  
4. Load the template JSON file (e.g. `az104-10-vms-edge-template.json`).  
5. Load the parameter file (e.g. `az104-10-vms-edge-parameters.json`).  
6. Fill in deployment settings:
   - Subscription  
   - Resource group (e.g. `az104-rg-region1`)  
   - Region (e.g. East US)  
   - VM admin username / password  
7. Review + create → deploy the stack (VM + VNet)  
8. Wait deployment to complete → Go to resource  
